#cols[(3) $(x + 3)/(2x - 7) - (2x - 1)/(x - 3) = 0$；][(4) $(x + 1)/(x - 1) + (x - 1)/(x + 1) = (x^2 + 7)/(2(x^2 - 1))$；]

